<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Error | FinSecure</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar"><strong>🔒 FinSecure Portal (Secure App)</strong></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Oops!</h2>
    <div class="error-box"><%= message %></div>
    <p class="hint">No stack trace, SQL error text, or file paths are ever shown here —
      full details are logged server-side only (see the error-handling middleware
      in <code>secure-app/server.js</code>).</p>
    <p><a href="/login">Back to login</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
